OL,3,GNEWSASnooker champion Graeme Dott
OL,4,Aguilty of child sex abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer world snooker champion Graeme
OL,7,FDott has been found guilty of child
OL,8,Fsexual abuse.
OL,10,FThe 49-year-old denied two charges of
OL,11,Flewd and libidinous behaviour towards a
OL,12,Fgirl and a boy between 1993 and 2010.
OL,14,FDuring a trial, the High Court in
OL,15,FGlasgow heard that Dott had exposed
OL,16,Fhimself and inappropriately touched a
OL,17,Fprimary school girl in the 1990s and
OL,18,Fattacked a young boy between 2006 and
OL,19,F2010.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
