OL,3,GNEWSASnooker champion Graeme Dott
OL,4,Aguilty of child sex abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FLord Harrower told Dott, who won the
OL,7,FWorld Snooker Championship in 2006, he
OL,8,Fwould be sentenced at a separate
OL,9,Fhearing in Edinburgh on 29 September.
